From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Judd <ipajudd@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:36:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Restore the crucible supports the 3.30 export dropped

Crucible.lua was regenerated in "Run export scripts" before "Fix granted
effect stat descriptions disappearing", so the 181 weapon tree passives
that grant a support gem ("Socketed Gems are Supported by Level 30 Added
Chaos Damage Support") had no text and were left out.

The lines are written as crucible.lua writes them with the granted effect
fix, from the 3.30 game data, each in the place 3.29 had it.
---
 src/Data/Crucible.lua | 181 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 181 insertions(+)

